holder of this item gains:</b>\n\n</p>\n<ul><li><b><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Regeneration\" title=\"Scarlet Regeneration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Scarlet_Regeneration_Icon.webp/40px-Scarlet_Regeneration_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Scarlet_Regeneration_Icon.webp/60px-Scarlet_Regeneration_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Scarlet_Regeneration_Icon.webp/80px-Scarlet_Regeneration_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scarlet Regeneration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Scarlet_Regeneration_Icon.webp/40px-Scarlet_Regeneration_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Scarlet_Regeneration_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Regeneration\" title=\"Scarlet Regeneration\">Scarlet Regeneration</a>:</b> If you have a +3 bonus from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_(Condition)\" title=\"Scarlet Remittance +3 (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scarlet Remittance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Remittance_%2B3_(Condition)\" title=\"Scarlet Remittance +3 (Condition)\">Scarlet Remittance</a>, consume it to recover <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">3d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>).</li></ul>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Remittance\" title=\"Scarlet Remittance\">Scarlet Remittance</a></dt><dd>Gain a +1 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span cl